# Copy to .dev.vars for `npx wrangler dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
# Every line is optional: with none of them the game plays in full, offline.

# Lets Claude speak for the court. Uncomment and fill in; a placeholder left in place
# counts as a key and every answer fails.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key

# If set, players must enter the same key under Settings before the court will listen.
# COURT_KEY=choose-a-phrase

# Model overrides. Leave out to use the defaults in src/server/worker.ts.
# WORD_MODEL=
# WORD_MODEL_DEFAULT_TIER=
# WORKERS_AI_MODEL=
